Patch 6003: the TOC candidate harvest in ppu_lifter accepts a TOC base up to 0x8000 past the end of the segment holding its
OPD pairs (R&C pass 10, 2026-10-19). Tools of Destruction has three TOCs; the third (0x8afe5c) lies past its segment (ends
0x8ad4e8), so its 119 jump-table dispatchers were never tried and their cases fell to ps3_indirect_call (first Proton start: unresolved
indirect call -> 0x00821F20). General; upstream candidate.

diff --git a/tools/ppu_lifter.py b/tools/ppu_lifter.py
index 0be2efb..d4d3151 100644
--- a/tools/ppu_lifter.py
+++ b/tools/ppu_lifter.py
